    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "As per prosecution story, on 17.02.2024 complainant Saroj Sakhwar during treatment at JAH Hospital lodged an oral complaint to the effect that on 16.02.2024, when she had gone to the house Madan Saini vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 8 May, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/96548681/\n1 of Rakhi asking for settlement in a case of rape filed by her against the husband of complainant,\nco-accused Gautam and Rakesh caught-hold of her hands and legs and Madan shut her mouth and thereupon all the three accused persons tried to outrage her modesty and after throwing her on the ground, they even tried to commit rape upon her, but when they were unsuccessful, that accused Rakhi poured petrol upon her and co-accused Suneeta, who is wife of accused Gautam, set her ablaze by means of a lighter.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1343,
      "end": 2151,
