      "text": "In her statement under Section 161 of Cr.P.C., name of applicant was also mentioned in FIR as well as dehati nalsi.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4254,
      "end": 4369,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 161",
          "label": "PROVISION",
