      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.32706376910209656
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "Co-accused Smt. Rakhi and Smt. Suneeta were not named in the dying declaration, therefore, the case of present applicant is not identical to that of co-accused Smt. Rakhi and Smt. Suneeta who have been enlarged on bail.",
